
                    DOOM 3 for AmigaOS 3 on the PiStorm
                    ===================================

                        Version @VERSION@ (@DATE@)

Doom 3 (id Software, 2004) running natively on a 68k Amiga with a PiStorm:
the game code runs on Emu68, and the graphics are drawn by the Raspberry
Pi 4's VideoCore GPU through ogles2.library (OpenGL ES 2.0 for AmigaOS 3).
The port is based on dhewm3/d3es, the GPL release of Doom 3's source.

The game's data is NOT included: you need your own copy of Doom 3 (the
GOG.com or Steam release, or a boxed copy updated to 1.3.1).


CONTENTS
--------

  1. What you need
  2. Installing
